# Observability

Status/logs should distinguish:

- Wi-Fi failure vs cloud uplink failure
- Modbus/CRC/timeout vs stale sample vs true zero
- Config/auth CLI failure vs bus failure
- Alarm/operating condition vs transport errors

Never log passwords, private keys, tokens, API secrets, or plaintext device credentials. Prefer actionable diagnostics over generic errors.
